  "implementation": {
    "family": "swapIn input-first semantics; declare quoteOutput/directOutput. Runtime quote accepts only actual FluidDexSwapResult declared revert. Direct path checks requested receiver, exact positive debit, exact quote/receipt match and old inventories. Default executor encoding preserved. swapInWithCallback is input-first and does not establish deferredInput.",
    "central": "Protocol-neutral VM call mode2 requires actual revert, exact bounded data length, zero value and no installed callback. Common issuer maps native output to executor, then measured ETH-to-WETH delivery reaches the original graph receiver. Positive exact direct debit, real credit and original native/WETH/input/output inventory guards retained.",
    "compatibility": "Old modes0/1 unchanged. New mode2 requires current BotVM runtime; old runtime rejects it. No deployment or broadcast performed. Native deferred-input remains unsupported."
  },
